<html>
  <head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>AI Podcast Editing Prompt Pack</title></head>
  <body>
    <h1>AI Podcast Editing Prompt Pack</h1>
    <p>Use these prompts to create a podcast editing offer, sample workflow, show notes, and client outreach.</p>
    <h2>Prompts</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Create a podcast editing service package for [niche] podcasters who publish [frequency]. Include deliverables, timeline, and pricing tiers.</li>
      <li>Analyze this podcast episode topic: [topic]. Create show notes, timestamps, title ideas, and a short episode description.</li>
      <li>Turn this transcript into 5 social media clips, 3 LinkedIn posts, and 5 short caption ideas: [transcript].</li>
      <li>Write a friendly outreach email to a podcaster in [niche] offering one free sample edit. Mention these audio/content issues: [issues].</li>
      <li>Create a client intake checklist for podcast editing, including files needed, style preferences, intro/outro notes, and publishing requirements.</li>
      <li>Write a before-and-after case study template for a podcast episode editing sample.</li>
      <li>Create a monthly retainer offer for 4 podcast episodes, including basic, standard, and premium options.</li>
      <li>Generate a quality-control checklist for final podcast delivery.</li>
      <li>Create a follow-up message after sending a free sample edit.</li>
      <li>Write a simple landing page for a podcast editing service targeting [niche].</li>
    </ol>
  </body>
</html>
